msgctxt "1920"
msgid "Recovering Health"
msgstr "Recuperando salud"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Health-conscious Woman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "56_Health-conscious Woman"
msgid "I love when guys eat a lot and have excessive amounts of health. Is that something you're into?"
msgstr "Estoy segura que los hombres que comen mucho tienen salud de sobra. ¿Acaso eres de esos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Health-conscious Woman"
msgid "There are five ways to recover health that you have lost in battle.\\r\n　　1. Eat at a restaurant\\r\n　　2. Go into facilities such as the hot springs\\r\n　　3. Eat food items\\r\n　　4. Use recovery items such as Staminan X\\r\n　　5. Rest up in your Hideout"
msgstr "Existen cinco formas de recuperar salud después de una pelea.\\r\n　　1. Comer/beber en un restaurante o bar.\\r\n　　2. Relajarte en lugares como las aguas termales.\\r\n　　3. Comer alimentos.\\r\n　　4. Usar un objeto de recuperación, como un Staminan X.\\r\n　　5. Descansar en un escondite."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Recovering Health
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "80_Health-conscious Woman"
msgid "If your health is low, you may want to heal before entering another potentially dangerous situation."
msgstr "Si tu salud es baja, tal vez quieras curarte antes de entrar en otra situación potencialmente peligrosa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "92_Health-conscious Woman"
msgid "This information has been added as a <Color:14>memo<Color:Default>.\\r\nRead <Color:14>memos<Color:Default> by selecting <Color:14>Memos<Color:Default> in the Pause Menu.\\r\nYou can access the Pause Menu with the <Action:Button_Options@Adventure> button."
msgstr "Esta información ha sido añadida como una <Color:14>nota<Color:Default>.\nLee las <Color:14>notas<Color:Default> seleccionando <Color:14>Notas<Color:Default> en el menú de pausa.\nPuedes acceder al menú de pausa con el botón <Action:Button_Options@Adventure>."

